msgstr "Aseqdec: ydotool <cmd> <args>\nTiludna yellan:"

msgid "Use release-all to recover held keys after a killed client.\n  -h, --help     Display this help and exit\n  -V, --version  Display version information and exit\nUse environment variable YDOTOOL_SOCKET to specify daemon socket."
msgstr "Seqdec release-all iwakken ad d-terreḍ tisekla yeṭṭfen ticki yenger umsaɣ.\n  -h, --help     Sken tallalt-agi sakin ffɣ\n  -V, --version  Sken talɣut n lqem sakin ffɣ\nSeqdec tawila n twennaḍt YDOTOOL_SOCKET i uskan n socket n daemon."

